          "text": "A veterinarian recommends that each day a certain rabbit should eat 25 calories per pound of the\nrabbit’$s$ weight, plus an additional 11 calories. Which equation represents this situation, where $c$\nis the total number of calories the veterinarian recommends the rabbit should eat each day if the\nrabbit’$s$ weight is $x$ pounds?"
